  <item>
    <title>笼子与胶囊：与黄健翔漫谈足球（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/653f5a699cb67569a2ebfba8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">653f5a699cb67569a2ebfba8</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 30 Oct 2023 07:25:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>﹝本期病友﹞</span></p><span></span><p><span>紫人（微博：@摩绪奴）</span></p><span></span><p><span>黄健翔（微博：@黄健翔）</span></p><span></span><p><span>﹝时间轴﹞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11">00:11</a> 禅师杰克逊一语道破</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 精英化的金丝笼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">04:25</a> 大因扎吉的吐槽引人思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> 野蛮成长的必要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="891">14:51</a> 育人和用人的瀑布机制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> 足球最迷人的地方包括人性暗面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1244">20:44</a> 球员单方向上的不能适应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a> 「Footbonaut」的局限性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1599">26:39</a> 城镇化与足球土壤的矛盾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1674">27:54</a> 球员作为大生产中的一个环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1834">30:34</a> 团体操审美与整体性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1942">32:22</a> 低端数据侵入足球</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2011">33:31</a> 足球比赛形态的独特且美妙之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 偶然派与必然派</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2316">38:36</a> 足球作为娱乐产业既要又要了吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2743">45:43</a> 2010 年作为分水岭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2825">47:05</a> 克鲁伊夫和古力特都是大文化 IP</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2850">47:30</a> 杜舍尔是被网暴先驱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2931">48:51</a> 温室花朵也分三六九等</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2960">49:20</a> 齐丹亲历马拉多纳天神下凡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3386">56:26</a> 看球这件事里也涉及脑科学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a> 黄健翔回答足球迷灵魂三问</span></p><span></span><p><span>﹝背景音乐﹞</span></p><span></span><p><span>Four Organs - Steve Reich</span></p><span></span><p><span>New York Counterpoint - Steve Reich</span></p><span></span><p><span>﹝怎么交流病情﹞</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：@摩绪奴&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：摩绪奴</span></p><span></span><p><span>哔哩哔哩：摩绪奴</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvJ8IJhI1ibabr-MthkYXhWkc6w1.m4a" length="127359676" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:05:58</itunes:duration>
